message: "If you reference this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "MedScript OPD"
abstract: >
  Sovereign offline-first Electronic Medical Records (EMR) and clinical
  prescription management system for independent physicians and outpatient
  clinics in India. Features cryptographic prescription integrity sealing,
  real-time drug-drug interaction surveillance, ICD-10 diagnostic coding,
  role-based clinical access control, and FHIR R4 health data interoperability.
